        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en-Us",
            "description": "Using a survey approach, this study assesses disaster loss, social and community experiences, and psychological state due to hurricanes/floods in Lafayette, Louisiana and surrounding areas. IRB documents, instruments, and the protocol are shared under the Research Planning Collections. The data of this project are restricted. In the Social Science Collection - Restricted Survey Data, the reason for data restriction is explained and a summary of data characteristics is included.",
